<title>UK: Daimler-Benz sets $100 mln 3-year bond.</title>
<headline>Daimler-Benz sets $100 mln 3-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Goldman Sachs International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DAIMLER-BENZ UK PLC</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  DAIMLER-BENZ AG</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON     **	  MATURITY    25.FEB.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    25.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+33 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	**TO BE PRICED LATER</p>
<p> MOODY	A1	  LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/GE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.225     SELL CONC  1.5	 PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
